            {
              "id": "1770872826316_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a subtitle string based on the following rules, using the values for Organization Code (`{{$context.$variables.ContextOrganizationCode}}`) and Work Order Number (`{{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}}`):\n\n- If both organization code and work order number are present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Resource Assignments | Organization: {{$context.$variables.ContextOrganizationCode}} | Work Order: {{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}}`\n- If only organization code is present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Resource Assignments | Organization: {{$context.$variables.ContextOrganizationCode}}`\n- If only work order number is present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Resource Assignments | Work Order: {{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}}`\n- Otherwise, use:  \n  `Resource Assignments`\n\nReturn only the generated subtitle string. Do not return literal strings \"null\", null, empty values, or curly braces in the subtitle string."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
